 correlation</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/65 dark:text-paper/65">Reverse Phone OSINT and Social Account Correlation use public indexed pages and public profile links only. Correlations are evidence leads, not proof of identity or account ownership.</p></article></div><div class="mt-8 border border-amber-400/70 bg-amber-400/10 p-6"><p class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">[ ! ] sensitive information warning</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-100/80">Do not submit private credentials, private messages, authentication tokens, leaked data, or information you do not have permission to inspect. Review reports before sharing them because metadata, phone numbers, URLs, and social associations can be sensitive.</p></div><div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none text-ink/70 dark:prose-invert dark:text-paper/70"><h2>Retention and configuration</h2><p>Scan reports may be stored in the configured application database for the report workflow. Uploaded images are processed from temporary upload storage and are not deliberately persisted by the EXIF flow. Production operators should configure temporary-file cleanup, database retention, logs, backups, and access controls according to their policy.</p><h2>Responsible use</h2><p>Only inspect websites, business contacts, images, and public profiles that you own or have permission to assess. The tools do not bypass authentication, enumerate private accounts, track people, find passwords, access breached databases, or make definitive real-world identity claims.</p></div><a class="mt-10 inline-block border border-coral px-5 py-3 font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-coral hover:bg-coral hover:text-paper" href="{{ route('home') }}">← back to toolkit</a></section>@endsection
